{"code":"352090","name":"스톰테크","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"가정용기기와용품","sector_desc":"가전·생활가전. 소비 경기와 신제품 출시, 해외 판매에 민감합니다.","desc":"동사는 1999년 설립된 가정용 정수기 부품 전문 제조업체로, 2023년 코스닥 시장에 상장하였음. 종속회사를 통해 전자 및 통신기기에 사용되는 인쇄회로기판(PCB) 사업도 영위하고 있음. 정수기부품 사업에서는 피팅, 밸브, 안전 파우셋, 튜빙 아세이 등 정수기 핵심 부품을 개발·생산하며, 코웨이, LG전자, 쿠쿠홈시스, SK인텔릭스, 청호나이스 등 국내 주요 정수기 제조업체에 납품하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-20","n_days":299,"close":3725.0,"open":3735.0,"high":3735.0,"low":3680.0,"volume":15231,"amount":56735475.0,"ret_1d":-0.9309,"gap":-0.6649,"range_pct":1.4765,"ret_5":2.0548,"ret_20":2.0548,"ret_60":5.9744,"ret_120":-2.4869,"ret_250":2.6171,"ma20":3671.0,"ma60":3637.75,"ma120":3645.0417,"ma200":3618.925,"close_vs_ma200":2.9311,"close_vs_ma60":2.3985,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":1.0,"slope_60":20.0326,"r2_60":0.3862,"slope_120":-4.599,"r2_120":0.0466,"slope_250":0.2033,"r2_250":0.0003,"high52":4200.0,"low52":3330.0,"pos_52w":45.4023,"dd_52w":-11.3095,"mdd_1y":-13.7453,"atr14_pct":2.6366,"vol_ann_60":19.9419,"vol_avg20":53951.7,"vol_ratio20":0.2823,"vr5":0.9497,"vr20":1.2182,"amount_avg5":139264092.0,"amount_avg20":196415646.25,"amount_avg60":146894410.5,"obv_chg20":-54.1401,"turnover_20":4.0153,"pv_eff_20":0.5117,"rsi14":56.6744,"frgn_net_5":30912.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.115,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.115,"frgn_net_20":1346.0,"inst_net_20":-15796.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.005,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.0588,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0538,"frgn_net_60":36107.0,"inst_net_60":-55188.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.1344,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.2054,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.071,"frgn_net_120":89073.0,"inst_net_120":-82091.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.3315,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.3055,"smart_net_120_pct":0.026,"foreign_ratio":1.77,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.09,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":46.0,"op_margin_q":22.1154,"op_qoq":100.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":9.5238,"rev_yoy":2.9703,"op_trend_4q":7.7519,"fin_period":"202606","roe":12.09,"debt_ratio":45.23,"per":9.13,"pbr":1.11,"div_yield":12.08,"foreign_ra